  20: def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:
  21:     """Pack the hollow square frames into a contiguous strip ordered by their original positions.
  22: 
  23:     Input structure
  24:     - A black-background scene of separated monochrome 4x4 objects: hollow square frames and solid square distractors.
  25:     Rule
  26:     - Keep only the hollow frames and paste them edge-to-edge into one strip.
  27:     - If the hollow-frame positions spread more by column than row, pack left-to-right ordered by column; otherwise pack top-to-bottom ordered by row.
  28:     Key insight
